Version: beta-v1.1.3
Changelog: |
  This release fixes the post-install update loop that could prevent SLSsteam from working after accepting an update.

  Highlights:
  - Only an explicit pending-update marker can start the full post-update installer.
  - Prevented the normal update-all.sh resource from being mistaken for a pending update.
  - Prevented malformed config.yaml boolean values from aborting Steam during startup.
  - Added loader safety checks for unnamed link maps during early Steam startup.
  - Fixed fresh-device Steam wrapper creation and native launcher detection.
  - Ensured the bundled, tested SLSsteam payload is installed after Headcrab.
  - Preserved the full update flow for SLSsteam, ACCELA, and Headcrab.
  - Corrected LUA appid handling so game IDs resolve more reliably.
  - Fixed ACCELA AppID resolution logic.
  - Improved the update flow so Steam can restart safely while binaries are replaced.

DownloadUrl: https://github.com/TropicalFrog3/SLSsteam_n_ACCELA/releases/download/${version}/SLSsteam-n-ACCELA.zip
